# Altery
# QuantumultX filter_remote rule
# Usage: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/<your-username>/<your-repo>/main/altery.list, tag=Altery, force-policy=PROXY, update-interval=86400, opt-parser=true, enabled=true

HOST-SUFFIX,altery.com
HOST-SUFFIX,app.altery.com
HOST-SUFFIX,help.altery.com
HOST-SUFFIX,status.altery.com
HOST-SUFFIX,altery.onelink.me
HOST-KEYWORD,altery
